{"synopsis":"Bahkan semut pun bisa bangkit kembali dalam hidup, jika dia bekerja keras. Tidak ada yang ditakdirkan, kamu dan aku sama-sama bisa menjadi kuda hitam. Game (dunia yuan) turun dalam kenyataan, pemain memperoleh kemampuan karakter, dunia kemudian mengalami kekacauan. Menyembunyikan niatnya untuk menang tetapi takut mati reinkarnasi liu yi, pertama-tama, dia perlu mulai menganggap serius permainan dan mengatasi ketakutannya dan tidak takut, sehingga dia bisa menjadi pahlawan, dan menyelamatkan dunia. tapi apakah dia bisa melakukan itu? cari tahu lebih lanjut dengan membacanya","alternative_title":"从认真玩游戏开始崛起","author":"路人甘, Lu Ren Gan","artist":"Lu Ren Gan","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"a108abf4-f5a7-4771-a3c4-bbc60abeee9f","number":"199","chapter":"199","title":"","date":"2025-05-15","released":"2025-05-15"},{"chapter_id":"e9f2273b-2d63-463f-be31-f0f612f3cd1c","number":"198","chapter":"198","title":"","date":"2025-05-14","released":"2025-05-14"},{"chapter_id":"a444aa7f-b969-4d5b-bd94-7e5179f1e98e","number":"197","chapter":"197","title":"","date":"2025-05-13","released":"2025-05-13"},{"chapter_id":"5add3c9e-b7a0-4372-b3e0-adff8432dbdc","number":"196","chapter":"196","title":"","date":"2025-05-12","released":"2025-05-12"},{"chapter_id":"421b7c7e-e4ce-4c5d-a2e5-a73026ee5025","number":"195","chapter":"195","title":"","date":"2025-05-11","released":"2025-05-11"},{"chapter_id":"ce8b5695-01a2-457a-97e3-411f73ae859d","number":"194","chapter":"194","title":"","date":"2025-05-06","released":"2025-05-06"},{"chapter_id":"c4723f43-51e5-4ea8-9a65-7819c465ff7b","number":"193","chapter":"193","title":"","date":"2025-05-05","released":"2025-05-05"},{"chapter_id":"9cfeb4ea-0ca3-4420-b9d2-ec6d728577b9","number":"192","chapter":"192","title":"","date":"2025-05-04","released":"2025-05-04"},{"chapter_id":"98986b12-cbd7-40d4-8b32-0683427b0781","number":"191","chapter":"191","title":"","date":"2025-05-03","released":"2025-05-03"},{"chapter_id":"aecd462e-3c65-453a-90de-1dfc528ba750"